    pauseIndex: 06000000060000002b0000002b0000007c0000007c000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: You forgive yourself. $$You forgive everyone. $$You decide to believe in
      humanity despite all that has happened.$.$. $$Is this what you want, $$Rika?
    displayText: You forgive yourself. You forgive everyone. You decide to believe
      in humanity despite all that has happened... Is this what you want, Rika?
